e.\n\n   So in the rewrite, the 行业竞争 perspective should:\n   - 击球区: 🟡 (consistent with 商业模式 🟡 and 财务估值 🟡; 风险评估 is 🔴 with reasoned basis)\n   - 建仓价: 33.5 元（除息）— consistent with 商业模式's 33.5 (which itself is \"与财务估值视角的 35/30 元差 1 元以内\"). Hmm, but what exactly should the 行业竞争 numbers be?\n\n   Let me re-read the task: \"使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐：同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点。\"\n\n   The other three:\n   - 财务估值: 建仓 35, 补仓 30, 内在 +11% (from 37.45 baseline), 击球区 🟡 附近\n   - 风险评估: 建仓 30, 补仓 27, 内在 −9.7%, 击球区 🔴 (with basis)\n   - 商业模式: 建仓 33.5（除息）, 补仓 29.5（除息）, 内在 +18%, 击球区 🟡 接近上沿\n\n   The 商业模式 (Aug 20, the newest rewrite) says it aligned with the others and notes 行业竞争视角 confirmed \"35 元以下舒适击球区\". The 商业模式 file's alignment table says the consensus is: 🟡, 建仓 33.5 (除息) / 35 (含息-ish), 补仓 29.5-30, 内在 +18~19% vs 现价 34.63.\n\n   So for the rewritten 行业竞争 file, the quantified conclusion should be:\n   - 内在涨幅: +18% (aligned with 商业模式's +18% / 财务估值's +19% current-price basis)? Or use the 行业竞争's own computation?\n   - 击球区: 🟡\n   - 目标建仓价: 33.5 元 (aligned with 商业模式)\n   - 二次补仓价: 29.5 元 (aligned)\n   - 数据核验: ✓\n\n   The 行业竞争 perspective has its own methodology: 行业打分 8.4/10, 竞争格局 9/10, etc. The valuation anchor from the industry view: \"问题不在行业，而在价格\" (the problem isn't the industry, it's the price).\n\n   Now the current price: the newest data cutoff is 08-19 (除息参考价 34.63 元, 08-18 收盘 35.18 元). The 商业模式 report uses 34.63 除息 as the price basis and computes:\n   - 内在价值中枢 3800 亿 (每股 40.9 元除息后) → +18.1% vs 34.63\n   - 建仓 33.5 (除息) = 40.9 × 82%\n   - 补仓 29.5 (除息) = 40.9 × 72%\n   \n   For the 行业竞争 rewrite, I should use the same price basis (35.18 含息 / 34.63 除息, 数据截止 2026-08-19, 报告日期 2026-08-20 or today 08-21?). Today's date is Aug 21, 2026. Hmm — the AGENTS.md says to run `date` to confirm today's date. The environment says today's date is Friday, Aug 21, 2026. Let me run date to confirm as per project rules.\n\n   Actually, the research rules say: \"Before starting any research, run the date command to confirm today's date.\" I should run date. Also there might be a newer price by now (08-20 收盘?). But the other three reports use 08-18 收盘/08-19 除息 as cutoff. The task says align with the other three newest reports — so data cutoff should stay 2026-08-19 (除息日). I shouldn't introduce new price data beyond that unless needed. The safest approach: align to the 08-19 cutoff used by the other reports (商业模式 rewrite dated 08-20 uses 08-18 收盘 35.18/除息 34.63).\n\n   Wait, but the report date for the rewritten file — I'll date it 2026-08-21 (today) as a rewrite aligning to the 08-19 round. Actually the 商业模式 rewrite says \"报告日期：2026-08-20（本文件为 2026-08-11 首轮报告的重写版...）\". For consistency I could write 报告日期 2026-08-21 as the rewrite date with 数据截止 2026-08-19. Let me confirm today's date with `date` first.\n\n   Now, how to structure the rewritten 行业竞争 file? The task says: \"保持 行业竞争 视角的分析立场与方法论，但数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告.\"\n\n   So I should rewrite the old file (which was the 08-11 first round) as a full, standalone report (not incremental like the -20260819 one), incorporating:\n   - The industry competition content (both rounds' findings — but especially the latest facts: 提价权测试, 大华 H1 数据, 财库2号文, FCC 祖父条款, 萤石修正, 机器人 IPO 后移, 行业打分 8.4/10)\n   - Aligned data: 现价 35.18/34.63, TTM 净利 164.36 亿, PE-TTM 19.3x, 股本 91.65 亿股, 2026E 净利 175-190 亿, 毛利率 49.97% vs 大华 43.06% (6.91pct), etc.\n   - Aligned valuation conclusions: 建仓 33.5（除息）, 补仓 29.5（除息）, 内在 +18%, 击球区 🟡\n   - End with \"## 量化结论\" section with exactly the five lines in the specified format.\n\n   The five lines format (字段名与格式禁止改动):\n   ```\n   - 内在涨幅: **X%**\n   - 击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\n   - 目标建仓价: **X 元**\n   - 二次补仓价: **X 元**\n   - 数据核验: ✓/⚠️ 说明\n   ```\n\n   The field names must be exactly: 内在涨幅, 击球区, 目标建仓价, 二次补仓价, 数据核验. The format `**X%**` etc. Looking at other files' 量化结论 sections, they add explanatory text after the bold value — e.g. 商业模式: \"- 内在涨幅: **+18%**（除息口径：...）\". The instruction says \"字段名与格式禁止改动\" — field names and format must not change. Extra explanation after seems acceptable based on the other reports' style, but to be safe I'll keep explanations concise and keep the exact five line structure with the field names and **bold** values. Actually the 商业模式 file does exactly this. I'll follow that pattern: `- 内在涨幅: **+18%**（...说明...）`.\n\n   Now, what should the numbers be for the 行业竞争 perspective? The task says the four views' 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅 should be consistent unless there's a reasoned difference. The consensus (from 商业模式's alignment table):\n   - 击球区: 🟡 (three views; 风险评估 🔴 with basis)\n   - 建仓价: 33.5 元（除息口径）— 商业模式's. 财务估值 35 元 (its baseline was 37.45 含息; 35 含息 ≈ 34.45 除息). Hmm. Actually 财务估值's 35 was based on 37.45 baseline without 除息 adjustment (08-11 report). 商业模式 notes \"与财务估值视角的 35/30 元差 1 元以内\".\n   - 补仓价: 29.5（商业模式）/ 30（财务估值）/ 30（风险评估建仓）\n   - 内在涨幅: +18%（商业模式, vs 34.63 除息）/ +19%（财务估值中性目标 41.2 vs 34.63 现价）+11%（财务估值加权, 37.45 基线）/−9.7%（风险评估, with basis）\n\n   For the 行业竞争 rewrite, I should align with 商业模式's conclusions since that's the newest alignment: 🟡, 建仓 33.5 元（除息）, 补仓 29.5 元（除息）, 内在 +18%.\n\n   And the 行业竞争 perspective can compute the +18% in its own way: the industry view's valuation anchor. The old 行业竞争 file had its own three-scenario: 保守160×19=3040亿/-11%、中性175×21=3675亿/+8%、乐观190×22=4180亿/+22%. To align with 商业模式: 中枢 3800 亿 (190×20), 保守 3150 亿 (175×18), 乐观 4180 亿 (190×22). The 行业竞争 view could adopt the same central case 3800 亿 → 40.9 元除息后 → +18% vs 34.63. That's consistent.\n\n   Alternatively, the 行业竞争 view could use 中性175×21=3675亿 (its own earlier methodology) → 40.1 元 → +15.8%. But the task says conclusions should align → use the team consensus: +18% central.\n\n   I'll compute: 内在价值中枢 3800 亿（2026E 190 亿 × 20x，团队口径）→ 每股 41.5 元含息 / 40.9 元除息 → vs 现价 34.63（除息）→ +18.1%. Consistent with 商业模式.\n\n   For the 行业竞争's reasoned standpoint: the industry view's core message is \"行业在变好、价格在下跌——问题不在行业而在价格；行业打分 8.4/10；击球区：价格已进入上轮'35 元以下舒适区'（除息后 34.63），但距离建仓价 33.5 还有约 3.3%，且 SDN 传闻悬置 + 存储周期反转风险未出清，维持 🟡\".\n\n   Wait — one nuance: the old 行业竞争 file said \"35 元以下进入舒适击球区\" and the 20260819 file said \"除息后理论价34.63元已进入上轮设定的'35元以下舒适击球区'\". So the 行业竞争 view has been the most price-friendly. But now with the team-aligned 建仓价 33.5, the industry view should align: its \"舒适击球区\" concept maps to 建仓价 33.5. Actually let me re-read the 商业模式 alignment table: \"行业竞争（芒格） | 08-19 | 已进入\"35 元以下舒适击球区\"（不给价格结论）\". And 商业模式's own conclusion: \"行业竞争视角已确认价格进入其\"35 元以下舒适区\"\".\n\n   So in the rewrite, the 行业竞争 view should give explicit price conclusions now (the task requires the 量化结论 five lines with 目标建仓价 and 二次补仓价 — so it MUST give price conclusions now). And those should be consistent: 33.5 / 29.5.\n\n   Hmm, but wait — is it \"consistent\" to have 行业竞争 give 33.5? The task: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\". The 行业竞争 view could have a reasoned difference (e.g., it's the most bullish on industry quality, so could argue for a slightly higher entry price, e.g. 34 元). But the safest interpretation of \"一致\" is to use the same numbers as the 商业模式 aligned consensus: 33.5/29.5, +18%, 🟡. \n\n   Actually, let me think about whether 行业竞争 should use exactly 33.5/29.5. The 商业模式 report's alignment table explicitly says the team consensus build price is 33.5 (除息口径, = 原 34.0 含息 − 0.55), 补仓 29.5 (= 原 30.0 含息 − 0.55). The old 行业竞争 had 35/31 (含息口径). If I convert the old 行业竞争's numbers to 除息口径: 35−0.55=34.45, 31−0.55=30.45. That's close to but not equal to 33.5/29.5.\n\n   The task instruction is clear: align. The 商业模式 rewrite is the newest and says \"与财务估值/行业竞争视角一致\" for its 33.5/29.5 — treating 行业竞争 as consistent with it. So the rewritten 行业竞争 should adopt 33.5/29.5 (除息口径) and note the mapping from its previous 35/31 含息 values. That maintains internal consistency with what 商业模式 claims about it.\n\n   Hmm, but actually there's a subtlety: the old 行业竞争 35 元建仓 corresponds to 34.45 除息, which is 0.95 元 above 33.5. The 商业模式 report says \"建仓/补仓价：本视角 33.5/29.5 元（除息口径）= 原 34.0/30